Package: HRIC
Type: Package
Title: Hellinger-Riemann Intrinsic Coordinates and Diversity
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person(
        given = "Yiqian",
        family = "Zhang",
        role = c("aut", "cre"),
        email = "zhang.16383@osu.edu"
    )
Description: Provides Hellinger-Riemann intrinsic coordinates and
    reference-based coordinates for compositional data on the closed
    simplex, together with Simplex Hellinger alpha, beta, and gamma
    diversity summaries and a between-group turnover statistic. The
    methods use square-root compositions and angular calibration,
    allowing exact zeros without pseudo-count replacement.
